WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:07.155
What the 169 experts and the 0.0067 nats actually are.

00:00:07.155 --> 00:00:11.814
A three-day-old README, checked against its own repository.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.687
Two-level routing, from a pool of 169.

00:00:16.687 --> 00:00:20.573
32 of 169: resident experts per passage.

00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:23.904
8 of 169: picked per character.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:28.622
Forgetting on the seven subjects not read, nats.

00:00:28.622 --> 00:00:33.086
Trunk at full rate, 2.23; trunk at one tenth, 0.0067.

00:00:33.086 --> 00:00:36.658
